ot, referat, kurs ishi va barcha hujjat xizmatlari uchun.\"},\"video_credits\":{\"name\":\"Video kreditlar\",\"hint\":\"Video yaratish uchun. Narx effekt va uzunlikka qarab o‘zgaradi.\"}}},\"app\":{\"nav\":{\"create\":\"Yaratish\",\"library\":\"Fayllarim\",\"services\":\"Xizmatlar\",\"billing\":\"Tarif va to‘lovlar\",\"settings\":\"Sozlamalar\",\"signOut\":\"Chiqish\",\"toggleSidebar\":\"Panelni yig‘ish\",\"manage\":\"Boshqarish\",\"menu\":\"Menyu\"},\"create\":{\"title\":\"Nima yaratamiz?\",\"greeting\":\"Salom, {name}\",\"subtitle\":\"O‘z so‘zlaringiz bilan yozing — qolganini biz bajaramiz.\",\"placeholder\":\"Mavzuni yozing…\",\"generate\":\"Yaratish\",\"parametersSoon\":\"Bu xizmat sozlamalari keyingi relizda qo‘shiladi\",\"noServices\":\"Xizmatlar mavjud emas\",\"pickerTitle\":\"Nima yaratamiz?\",\"pickerDescription\":\"Xizmatni tanlang — qolganini shu yerda yozasiz.\",\"pickerSearch\":\"Xizmatni qidirish…\",\"pickerNoMatches\":\"Bunday xizmat topilmadi\"},\"library\":{\"title\":\"Fayllarim\",\"count\":\"{total} ta\",\"searchPlaceholder\":\"Sarlavha bo‘yicha qidirish…\",\"serviceFilter\":\"Xizmat\",\"statusFilter\":\"Holat\",\"allServices\":\"Barcha xizmatlar\",\"clearFilters\":\"Filtrlarni tozalash\",\"status\":{\"all\":\"Barchasi\",\"completed\":\"Tayyor\",\"not_completed\":\"Jarayonda\"},\"emptyTitle\":\"Hali hech narsa yo‘q\",\"emptyDescription\":\"Yaratgan barcha ishlaringiz shu yerda saqlanadi va qidiriladi.\",\"startCreating\":\"Yaratishni boshlash\",\"noMatchesTitle\":\"Bu filtrga mos natija yo‘q\",\"noMatchesDescription\":\"Boshqa xizmat, holat yoki qidiruv so‘zini sinab ko‘ring.\",\"loadFailed\":\"Fayllaringizni yuklab bo‘lmadi\",\"loadFailedDescription\":\"Hech narsa yo‘qolmadi — shunchaki ro‘yxat kelmadi.\",\"retry\":\"Qayta urinish\",\"untitled\":\"Sarlavhasiz\",\"downloaded\":\"Yuklab olingan\",\"download\":\"Yuklab olish\",\"loadingFiles\":\"Fayllar yuklanmoqda…\",\"noFiles\":\"Fayl topilmadi\",\"previous\":\"Oldingi\",\"next\":\"Keyingi\",\"page\":\"{pages} sahifadan {page}-si\"},\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Sozlamalar\",\"displayName\":\"Ism\",\"username\":\"Foydalanuvchi nomi\"},\"composer\":{\"moreOptions\":\"Ko‘proq sozlama\",\"fewerOptions\":\"Kamroq sozlama\",\"addTag\":\"Qo‘shish\",\"generating\":\"Yaratilmoqda…\",\"submit\":\"Yaratish\",\"quotaLeft\":\"{count} ta qoldi\",\"noQuota\":\"Limit tugagan\",\"quotaUnlimited\":\"Cheksiz\",\"optionsFor\":\"Sozlamalar\",\"required\":\"Majburiy\",\"resetOptions\":\"Tozalash\",\"doneOptions\":\"Tayyor\",\"images\":{\"add\":\"Rasm qo‘shish\",\"remove\":\"O‘chirish\",\"dropHint\":\"Rasmlarni shu yerga tashlang yoki tanlang\",\"remaining\":\"Yana {count} ta qo‘shish mumkin\",\"full\":\"Rasmlar soni chegarasiga yetdi\"}},\"generation\":{\"starting\":\"Boshlanmoqda…\",\"untitled\":\"Nomsiz\",\"status\":{\"pending\":\"Navbatda\",\"generating_reja\":\"Reja tuzilmoqda…\",\"generating_content\":\"Matn yozilmoqda…\",\"generating_images\":\"Rasmlar yaratilmoqda…\",\"generating_files\":\"Fayllar tayyorlanmoqda…\",\"generating_file\":\"Fayl tayyorlanmoqda…\",\"completed\":\"Tayyor\",\"failed\":\"Yaratib bo‘lmadi\"},\"dismiss\":\"Yopish\",\"progressLabel\":\"Yaratish jarayoni\",\"keepsRunning\":\"Jarayon serverda davom etadi — sahifani yopsangiz ham natija “Fayllarim”da paydo bo‘ladi.\",\"clearFinished\":\"Tugaganlarini yopish ({count})\"},\"templates\":{\"title\":\"Namunadan boshlang\",\"use\":\"Shu promptdan foydalanish\"}},\"pricing\":{\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Narxlar\",\"description\":\"SOFF AI tariflari: oyiga 45 000 so‘mdan taqdimot, referat, kurs ishi, dars ishlanmasi va testlarni cheksiz yarating. Yillik tarifda 45% tejang.\"},\"title\":\"Sizga mos tarifni tanlang\",\"subtitle\":\"Bitta obuna — barcha xizmatlar. Avtomatik yangilanishni istalgan vaqtda o‘chirasiz.\",\"yearlyHint\":\"Yillik tarif oylikka nisbatan {percent}% arzonroq.\",\"note\":\"Narxlar O‘zbekiston so‘mida. To‘lov Click orqali, karta ma’lumotlari bizda saqlanmaydi.\",\"cta\":{\"start\":\"Boshlash\",\"tryFree\":\"Bepul sinab ko‘rish\"},\"faq\":{\"title\":\"Tariflar haqida savollar\",\"items\":{\"whatIsFree\":{\"question\":\"Bepul tarifda nima bor?\",\"answer\":\"Freemium tarifi hisobingiz ochilganda avtomatik beriladi, lekin hujjat yaratish xizmatlari unga kirmaydi. Taqdimot, referat, kurs ishi va boshqalarni yaratish uchun Pro tarifi kerak.\"},\"renewal\":{\"question\":\"Tarif avtomatik yangilanadimi?\",\"answer\":\"Ha. Muddat tugaganda tarif o‘sha kartadan avtomatik uzaytiriladi. Avtomatik yangilanishni istalgan vaqtda “Tarif va to‘lovlar” sahifasidan o‘chirib qo‘yishingiz mumkin.\"},\"cancel\":{\"question\":\"Bekor qilsam, limitim darhol yo‘qoladimi?\",\"answer\":\"Yo‘q. Bekor qilish faqat avtomatik yangilanishni to‘xtatadi. Tarifingiz to‘langan muddat oxirigacha to‘liq ishlaydi.\"},\"payment\":{\"question\":\"Qanday to‘lash mumkin?\",\"answer\":\"Click orqali O‘zbekiston banklarining UZCARD va HUMO kartalari bilan. Karta ma’lumotlari to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri Click’ga boradi — SOFF AI ularni saqlamaydi.\"},\"refund\":{\"question\":\"Pulni qaytarib olsam bo‘ladimi?\",\"answer\":\"To‘langan muddat uchun pul qaytarilmaydi, lekin siz uni oxirigacha ishlatasiz. Shuning uchun avval oylik tarifni sinab ko‘rishni tavsiya qilamiz.\"}}},\"teaser\":{\"title\":\"Narxi qancha?\",\"yearly\":\"Yillik tarifda {percent}% tejaysiz\",\"cta\":\"Barcha tariflar\"},\"period\":{\"label\":\"To‘lov davri\",\"month\":\"Oylik\",\"year\":\"Yillik\"},\"allServices\":\"Barcha {count} ta xizmat kiradi\",\"included\":{\"title\":\"Bitta Pro tarifi barcha xizmatlarni ochadi\",\"body\":\"Har bir vosita uchun alohida to‘lov va qo‘shimcha to‘lovlar yo‘q: barcha {count} ta xizmat bitta balansdan foydalanadi. Siz vositalar to‘plamini emas, tarifni tanlaysiz.\"}},\"video\":{\"subtitle\":\"Effektni tanlang, rasm yoki matn qo‘shing — qolganini biz bajaramiz.\",\"promptPlaceholder\":\"Nima bo‘lishini yozing…\",\"generate\":\"Yaratish\",\"removeImage\":\"Rasmni olib tashlash\",\"requiresImage\":\"Bu effekt uchun rasm kerak\",\"notEnoughShort\":\"Kredit yetarli emas\",\"untitled\":\"Nomsiz video\",\"dismiss\":\"Yopish\",\"download\":\"Yuklab olish\",\"progressLabel\":\"Video yaratilmoqda\",\"takesMinutes\":\"Odatda 1–5 daqiqa oladi. Sahifani yopsangiz ham jarayon davom etadi.\",\"emptyCatalog\":\"Hozircha effektlar yo‘q\",\"catalogFailed\":\"Effektlarni yuklab bo‘lmadi\",\"catalogFailedDescription\":\"Ro‘yxat kelmadi. Qayta urinib ko‘ring.\",\"retry\":\"Qayta urinish\",\"categories\":{\"plain\":\"Effektsiz\",\"camera\":\"Kamera\",\"vfx\":\"Effektlar\",\"style\":\"Uslub\",\"text-to-video\":\"Matndan video\"},\"status\":{\"pending\":\"Navbatda\",\"queued\":\"Navbatda kutmoqda\",\"generating\":\"Video yaratilmoqda…\",\"downloading\":\"Yakunlanmoqda…\",\"completed\":\"Tayyor\",\"failed\":\"Yaratib bo‘lmadi\"},\"needImage\":\"Avval rasm yuklang\",\"uploading\":\"Rasm yuklanmoqda…\",\"needPrompt\":\"Avval matn yozing\",\"promptPlaceholderRequired\":\"Videoda nima bo‘lishini yozing…\",\"pickerTitle\":\"Effektni tanlang\",\"pickerHint\":\"Har bir effektning o‘z narxi bor.\",\"creditsLeft\":\"{count} kredit\",\"play\":\"Videoni ko’rish\",\"seconds\":\"{count} s\",\"addImage\":\"Rasm qo‘shish\",\"addRequiredImage\":\"Rasm kerak\",\"chooseEffect\":\"Effektni tanlang\",\"needEffect\":\"Avval effektni tanlang\",\"presetGone\":\"Bu effekt endi mavjud emas\"},\"image\":{\"subtitle\":\"Rasmni tasvirlang, uslub va kadr shaklini tanlang. Bir necha soniya oladi.\",\"promptPlaceholder\":\"Qanday rasm kerakligini yozing…\",\"generate\":\"Yaratish\",\"needPrompt\":\"Avval rasmni tasvirlang\",\"style\":\"Uslub\",\"untitled\":\"Nomsiz rasm\",\"dismiss\":\"Yopish\",\"download\":\"Yuklab olish\",\"view\":\"Rasmni ochish\",\"recent\":\"Sizning so‘nggi rasmlaringiz\",\"progressLabel\":\"Rasm yaratilishi\",\"takesSeconds\":\"Odatda bir necha soniya. Sahifani yopsangiz ham ish davom etadi.\",\"emptyCatalog\":\"Hozircha uslublar yo‘q\",\"catalogFailed\":\"Uslublarni yuklab bo‘lmadi\",\"catalogFailedDescription\":\"Ro‘yxat kelmadi. Yana urinib ko‘ring.\",\"retry\":\"Qayta urinish\",\"pickerTitle\":\"Uslubni tanlang\",\"pickerHint\":\"Barcha uslublar bir xil turadi. Kerakli ko‘rinishni tanlang.\",\"imagesLeft\":\"{count} ta rasm qoldi\",\"needPlan\":\"Rasm yaratish uchun tarif kerak\",\"outOfImages\":\"Bu oy uchun tarifdagi rasmlar tugadi\",\"needTokens\":\"Tokenlar yetmaydi — {count} ta kam\",\"status\":{\"pending\":\"Navbatda\",\"generating\":\"Rasm yaratilmoqda…\",\"completed\":\"Tayyor\",\"failed\":\"Yaratib bo‘lmadi\"}},\"faq\":{\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Savollar\",\"description\":\"SOFF AI qanday ishlaydi: tillar, yaratish vaqti, limitlar, natijani tahrirlash va keyin nima qo‘shiladi.\"},\"title\":\"Savollar\",\"items\":{\"languages\":{\"question\":\"Qaysi tillarda yozsam bo‘ladi?\",\"answer\":\"O‘zbek, rus va ingliz tillarida. Interfeys ham, yaratilgan ish ham siz tanlagan tilda bo‘ladi.\"},\"time\":{\"question\":\"Yaratish qancha vaqt oladi?\",\"answer\":\"Test yoki krossvord uchun taxminan 30 soniya, diplom yoki kurs ishi uchun bir necha daqiqa. Kutib turish shart emas.\"},\"quota\":{\"question\":\"Limit qanday ishlaydi?\",\"answer\":\"Har bir tarifda xizmatlar bo‘yicha oylik limit bor. Qolgan limit doim ko‘rinib turadi va sarflashdan oldin ogohlantiriladi.\"},\"editing\":{\"question\":\"Yaratilgan ishni tahrirlasam bo‘ladimi?\",\"answer\":\"Ha. Fayllar tahrirlanadigan formatda yuklanadi, premium taqdimotlarni esa platformaning o‘zida slaydma-slayd tahrirlash mumkin.\"},\"future\":{\"question\":\"Rasm va video generatsiyasi qachon qo‘shiladi?\",\"answer\":\"Ular navbatda. Platforma allaqachon ularga tayyor — yangi xizmatlar o‘sha interfeysga qo‘shiladi, siz hech narsani qaytadan o‘rganmaysiz.\"}},\"lead\":\"Yaratish qanday ketadi, tarifga nima kiradi va fayllar keyin qayerda qoladi.\",\"stillStuck\":\"Javob topilmadimi? Kiring va so‘rang — boshlash bepul.\",\"stillStuckCta\":\"Boshlash\",\"nextLabel\":\"Davomini o‘qish\"}},\"timeZone\":\"Asia/Tashkent\",\"children